<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News U.S. unit to redeem 2001 notes.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News U.S. unit to redeem 2001 notes.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The News Corp Ltd said on Monday its News America Holdings Inc unit would redeem on December 15, 1996 all of the outstanding December 15, 2001, 15 percent senior notes at the redemption price of 106 percent of the principal together with accrued and unpaid interest up to December 15, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
